          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "No. The Bobby Approved protein powder is FlavCity's All-in-One Protein Smoothie, and FlavCity lists only ShopFlavCity.com, Amazon, Target and TikTok Shop as authorized retailers. The Costco connection comes from Bobby Parrish's Costco haul videos and his app's store filter. At Costco, Ascent or Levels whey are the closest matches to his no-artificial-sweetener rules, if your warehouse stocks them."
          }
