          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "By ingredient list, it is cleaner than most: grass-fed whey, collagen, stevia, cocoa, fruit powders and no sucralose, gums or artificial colors, with 0 g added sugar per the label. Two caveats keep it from being a clear yes: roughly 10 g of each scoop is collagen rather than complete protein, and the bag carries a Prop 65 warning for lead and cadmium."
          }
